### Page 1 of 4

```text
MEMO

TO:

Honorable Mayor Patrick J. Collins, City of Cheyenne
Members of the City Council, City of Cheyenne

FROM:
Erin Gates

DATE:
April 9, 2024

SUBJECT:
Professional Service Agreement Contract Modification No. 2 between the City of
Cheyenne and Sunrise Engineering for additional engineering services for the 7th
Street Drainage and Access Improvements Project.

Please find attached Contract Modification No. 2 to the Professional Service Agreement between
the City of Cheyenne and Sunrise Engineering for additional engineering services related to the
drainage and access improvement designs for 7th Street.

Engineering staff evaluated the scope of services and corresponding fee proposal for the
engineering services based on time and material estimate for this specific project. Those costs are
readily tracked and verified during design operations and the City of Cheyenne will only pay for
the actual time expended. We believe this agreement will provide the required engineering design
services to complete the final design and construction documentation portion of the project.

The fees include services for project management, all construction documentation, and final plan
creation. Funding for this project will come from the 2019-2022 1% Optional Purpose Tax Fund
(5th Penny). The total professional services will be a cost not-to-exceed $6,500.00. We respectfully
request your approval of this professional services agreement.

CITY ENGINEER’S OFFICE
2101 O’Neil Avenue
Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001
```

