### Page 4 of 4

```text
March 15, 2024
Erin Gates, PE
City of Cheyenne, Engineering Department
2101 O’Neil Avenue
Cheyenne, WY 82001
Subject:  7th Street Drainage and Access Improvements – Contract Modification No. 2
Erin,
Below is our contract modification amount due to the modified and added scope during the final design
review meeting held on March 12th, 2024.  Those changes are as follows:

Coordination with BOPU regarding the proposed fire hydrant.
o
Prepare the necessary details and profile views.

Development of a sign summary for the signing and striping plans.

Change 7th Street and Platte Avenue from asphalt to concrete.
o
Updating all quantities and affected plan sheets
To make the above changes, we request an additional $6,500 to be billed on a time-and-materials
basis to complete the project.
Please let me know if you have any questions or comments.
Sincerely,
CJ Walker, PE
Service Center Manager
cwalker@sunrise-eng.com
Cheyenne Office
408 W. 23rd St., Suite 2, Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001 | Tel: 307.775.9500 | Fax: 307.775.9269
```
